{"id": "EUVD-2026-5891", "enisaUuid": "3eb4dfec-0702-332e-b995-dac266e887e1", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: hci_uart: fix null-ptr-deref in hci_uart_write_work\n\nhci_uart_set_proto() sets HCI_UART_PROTO_INIT before calling\nhci_uart_register_dev(), which calls proto->open() to initialize\nhu->priv. However, if a TTY write wakeup occurs during this window,\nhci_uart_tx_wakeup() may schedule write_work before hu->priv is\ninitialized, leading to a NULL pointer dereference in\nhci_uart_write_work() when proto->dequeue() accesses hu->priv.\n\nThe race condition is:\n\n  CPU0                              CPU1\n  ----                              ----\n  hci_uart_set_proto()\n    set_bit(HCI_UART_PROTO_INIT)\n    hci_uart_register_dev()\n                                    tty write wakeup\n                                      hci_uart_tty_wakeup()\n                                        hci_uart_tx_wakeup()\n                                          schedule_work(&hu->write_work)\n      proto->open(hu)\n        // initializes hu->priv\n                                    hci_uart_write_work()\n                                      hci_uart_dequeue()\n                                        proto->dequeue(hu)\n                                          // accesses hu->priv (NULL!)\n\nFix this by moving set_bit(HCI_UART_PROTO_INIT) after proto->open()\nsucceeds, ensuring hu->priv is initialized before any work can be\nscheduled.", "datePublished": "2026-02-14T16:01:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T18:25:33", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b0a900939e7e4866d9b90e9112514b72c451e873", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ccc683f597ceb28deb966427ae948e5ac739a909", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/937a573423ce5a96fdb1fd425dc6b8d8d4ab5779", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/186d147cf7689ba1f9b3ddb753ab634a84940cc9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/53e54cb31e667fca05b1808b990eac0807d1dab0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03e8c90c62233382042b7bd0fa8b8900552fdb62", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0c3cd7a0b862c37acbee6d9502107146cc944398"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-23146", "GHSA-hcr8-x92w-q652"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "00d6f61c-0bb1-3862-ad5d-6bebf44c7517", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13.12 <6.14"}, {"id": "0a41bed7-bf8b-3fce-92c9-539b9e800d14", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "80f14e9de6a43a0bd8194cad1003a3e6dcbc3984 <937a573423ce5a96fdb1fd425dc6b8d8d4ab5779"}, {"id": "167ce278-993e-31ad-84b8-bbebba684cd1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.123"}, {"id": "1e3f6258-a326-38f3-83a3-b9c537fc7457", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.6.88 <6.6.123"}, {"id": "24cca3c5-c4ba-313f-9414-75526319bff5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.69"}, {"id": "26c761ec-3682-38d6-847a-2b4a1d2121f4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.10.237 <5.10.249"}, {"id": "2a53e476-144b-385e-bb34-e079eccec8cd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "281782d2c6730241e300d630bb9f200d831ede71 <53e54cb31e667fca05b1808b990eac0807d1dab0"}, {"id": "2faf1517-c405-371b-b87b-043724e2bad2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.15"}, {"id": "35765f59-c103-32b0-9220-9d289b86518c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.14.3 <6.15"}, {"id": "402ce95d-0a4c-30f3-b9e5-0aecdf26c6d9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8e5aff600539e5faea294d9612cca50220e602b8"}, {"id": "470973db-ab88-35c1-b94a-c8ca2ad07d61", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "9e5a0f5777162e503400c70c6ed25fbbe2d38799 <ccc683f597ceb28deb966427ae948e5ac739a909"}, {"id": "479bc254-67c6-30f7-bba0-8fb7e87a37b5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.162"}, {"id": "4f04b14f-3d0c-3c32-94ba-8c72d165e8d6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.4.293 <5.5"}, {"id": "55d10c5c-391d-38cd-93a8-2738543569c9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1dcf08fcff5ca529de6dc0395091f28854f4e54a"}, {"id": "6584efff-a5f3-31e4-ada5-5d45147fb70f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "db7509fa110dd9b11134b75894677f30353b2c51"}, {"id": "6959714a-84ce-3f2c-a535-c9b6558f4835", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.9"}, {"id": "6a92cd37-a739-3267-9d26-6db0d8a0ee2e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.10.249"}, {"id": "80177ff4-014a-3f31-ba99-bf20ebcf17fe", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.15.199"}, {"id": "8ee88700-4943-3444-8a4f-f2b7b95f15cf", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5df5dafc171b90d0b8d51547a82657cd5a1986c7 <03e8c90c62233382042b7bd0fa8b8900552fdb62"}, {"id": "a88c5b3a-2711-3e04-91eb-09cffc1e49da", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12.24 <6.12.69"}, {"id": "a967af95-e247-3fa5-8b53-5f2a8c7fc522", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5df5dafc171b90d0b8d51547a82657cd5a1986c7 <0c3cd7a0b862c37acbee6d9502107146cc944398"}, {"id": "af7718ad-bb07-3fc5-9fe3-fa3572ba7b63", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "b7fc919e-1225-331d-90e1-99cc3d80f5c1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.19"}, {"id": "c9d64056